    <string name="location_foreground_disclosure_title">KidBox uses your location</string>
    <string name="location_foreground_disclosure_body">KidBox collects your device\'s location data to show you on the family map and to share your location with the family members you choose.\n\nYour location is only collected when you turn on sharing and is used exclusively for this feature: we don\'t sell it and we don\'t use it for ads. You can stop sharing at any time from the app.\n\nOn the next screen, Android will ask you to allow location access.</string>
