    <string name="location_background_disclosure_body">To share your location with your family and for arrival/departure zone (geofence) alerts, KidBox needs to access your location even when the app is closed or not in use (in the background).\n\nYour location is only used to show it to your family members and for the zones you set up. You can stop sharing at any time from the app.\n\nOn the next screen, select \"Allow all the time\" to turn this on.</string>
